{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13103100","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13103100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1310310001:1":{"text":"자, 이쪽으로요.","source_cn":"亲爱的，请走这里呦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DA66215C3419267","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310310002:1":{"text":"여긴 지하실로 통하는 것 같은데... 이 종목은 지하에서 진행되는 건가요?","source_cn":"这里好像通往地下室……这个项目是在地下举办的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59B251CED3A8EAC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310310003:1":{"text":"그럼요. 지하야말로 언제나 깊은 밤처럼 어둡고 고요하니까요.","source_cn":"当然啦，亲爱的。只有地下才能随时都像深夜般漆黑无光、寂...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07A72697E274BD6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310310004:1":{"text":"상상해 보세요. 그런 환경에서 갑자기 눈앞에 초록색 불빛이 나타났고, 그 불빛 뒤에서 누군가가 조용히 당신을 바라보고 있다고 말이에요...","source_cn":"想想看，在这样的环境里，你的眼前突然出现了一朵绿色的火...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA3785ED36CF8CA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310310005:1":{"text":"으악! 너무 무서워요... 아, 아, 아니, 안 무서워요!","source_cn":"哇！听起来好可怕……不，不可怕！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0171092E61E0B267","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310310006:1":{"text":"하하, 물론 이런 종목은 용감한 햄스터 씨와 아주 잘 어울린답니다. 자, 이건 “게임 설명서”에요. 별다른 문제가 없다면, 입장해서 준비해 주세요.","source_cn":"哈哈，当然，这样的项目正适合勇敢的仓鼠先生。喏，这是“...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04D407F12C36ABA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310310007:1":{"text":"가장 처음 밀실에서 나온 사람이 승자가 되고, 승자는 꽃잎 하나를 얻게 돼요!","source_cn":"第一位走出密室的朋友就是赢家，能得到一枚花瓣！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05A0BE5D34F3801A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格尔达":{"text":"게르다","source":"格尔达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}